        "prompt": "You are working inside milestone ${milestone_title} on a shared coding session.\n\nIntent stack JSON:\n${intent_stack}\n\nParent goal: #${goal_issue_number}\nThe parent goal context is for alignment only. Implement only the current issue.\n\nParent goal issue JSON:\n${goal_issue}\n\nCurrent implementation issue #${issue_number}: ${issue_title}\n\n${issue_body}\n\nReviewer notes (if any):\n${review_notes}\n\nFollow repo conventions. Run scoped checks relevant to your changes. Commit your work with a clear message referencing the issue.\n\nScope discipline:\n- Only modify files that are directly required by THIS issue's acceptance criteria.\n- If a pre-commit test or contract test fails on code you did NOT write or change, do NOT modify the failing test or the code it guards to make it pass. This branch is shared with sibling issues — changing files outside your scope can silently revert or break their work.",
